{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1490641-gifts-for-overcoming-blindness","id":1490641,"title":"Gifts for overcoming blindness?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-18T12:28:18-07:00","id":1490641,"title":"Gifts for overcoming blindness?","content":"Are there any Gifts, especially Garou Gifts, which allow blindness to be overcome?<br /> <br /> An example would be a Gift that lets you see through the eyes of animals, or see in total darkness through echolocation etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-18T12:32:40-07:00","id":1490643,"title":"","content":"Bat or dolphin gifts would do the trick","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-18T15:00:56-07:00","id":1490654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1490641-gifts-for-overcoming-blindness#post1490641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are there any Gifts, especially Garou Gifts, which allow blindness to be overcome?<br /> <br /> An example would be a Gift that lets you see through the eyes of animals, or see in total darkness through echolocation etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Scent of Sight is a Rank 2 Lupus Gift that allows you to use smell for this purpose. There's a handful of other examples. Cybersenses could be used for this as well, though it's easier if the blindness is situational.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-19T02:58:18-07:00","id":1490689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1490641-gifts-for-overcoming-blindness?p=1490654#post1490654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Scent of Sight is a Rank 2 Lupus Gift that allows you to use smell for this purpose. There's a handful of other examples. Cybersenses could be used for this as well, though it's easier if the blindness is situational.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's exactly what I was looking for! The Garou in question is a Blind Metis, so getting a wolf spirit to teach him an out-of-breed Gift might be a bit tricky. Still since he has a great need for the Gift, that's a good plot hook to follow! Though he's Rank 1, and also doesn't view his blindness as an 'obstacle' to overcome currently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-19T05:08:39-07:00","id":1490698,"title":"","content":"Wolf spirits are very common Gift teachers (~45 Gifts in the books, and plenty of lower level ones with many Auspices and Tribes having at least one Gift taught by a wolf spirit in the 1 to 3 range). Obviously as Garou-born, there will be some level of obstacle, but that's generally in your ST's hands for the tone of the game rather than rather than something wolf spirits are going to struggle with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-20T03:32:16-07:00","id":1490774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1490641-gifts-for-overcoming-blindness?p=1490689#post1490689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's exactly what I was looking for! The Garou in question is a Blind Metis, so getting a wolf spirit to teach him an out-of-breed Gift might be a bit tricky. Still since he has a great need for the Gift, that's a good plot hook to follow! Though he's Rank 1, and also doesn't view his blindness as an 'obstacle' to overcome currently.</div> </div> </div> </div>It should be pretty easy to get. Wolf spirits are your cousins anyway. Until then, may I recommend getting Heighthened Senses? It's a cheap low level gift and could give you a lot of information about the world, enough to lower the penalties and maybe even give a daredevil vibe.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-20T10:18:00-07:00","id":1490803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1490641-gifts-for-overcoming-blindness?p=1490774#post1490774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It should be pretty easy to get. Wolf spirits are your cousins anyway. Until then, may I recommend getting Heighthened Senses? It's a cheap low level gift and could give you a lot of information about the world, enough to lower the penalties and maybe even give a daredevil vibe.</div> </div> </div> </div>Already have Perception 4, Alertness 4, Primal Urge 2, and Heightened Senses (Hearing and Scent)!<br /> <br /> Plus he has an Eagle Jaggling who is his Spirit Companion background (DM adapted it from Revised) and he has a Lupus Kinfolk (his adoptive brother) who is disguised as his Husky Service Dog with a minor Fetish he wears.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-20T14:00:49-07:00","id":1490811,"title":"","content":"Do you mean Acute Senses (the Merit)? Heightened Senses is a Rank 1 lupus Gift (also taught by wolf spirits) that lowers your difficulty on all senses. Nothing says it doesn't stack with the Merit too (in case you're ever wondering how Garou with Blur of the Milky Eye ever get spotted).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-21T01:21:08-07:00","id":1490851,"title":"","content":"Ah yes I was talking about Acute Senses the merit. Will check out the Heightened Senses gift!<br /> <br /> So having checked it out, the Gnosis cost is really killing me!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11620,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","user":"twig","date":". 08-21-2022, 04:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-21T10:13:28-07:00","id":1490894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1490641-gifts-for-overcoming-blindness?p=1490851#post1490851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah yes I was talking about Acute Senses the merit. Will check out the Heightened Senses gift!<br /> <br /> So having checked it out, the Gnosis cost is really killing me!</div> </div> </div> </div>Well is the point to never ever have any difficluties from blindness, and if so, why even take blindness? With your build you will have only minor penalties from blindness, and when you decide to amp it all up with Heightened Senses you will be better than the people seeing things easily.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-21T11:51:14-07:00","id":1490909,"title":"","content":"Well a blind character is blind, whether or not they suffer penalties to checks to search for people, make attacks etc. Toph Beifong is a blind character, but she's not suffering penalties from it unless the task is &quot;put up posters&quot; or &quot;read a poster&quot;.<br /> <br /> Heightened Senses is a really cool Gift, but the cost being *Gnosis* specifically is pretty tricky, since it's the resource which is scarcest and hardest to recover. Would be much more excited by the Gift if it had a WP cost for instance. Still good to know that it exists and would help however.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-21T13:29:46-07:00","id":1490920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1490641-gifts-for-overcoming-blindness?p=1490909#post1490909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well a blind character is blind, whether or not they suffer penalties to checks to search for people, make attacks etc. Toph Beifong is a blind character, but she's not suffering penalties from it unless the task is &quot;put up posters&quot; or &quot;read a poster&quot;.<br /> <br /> Heightened Senses is a really cool Gift, but the cost being *Gnosis* specifically is pretty tricky, since it's the resource which is scarcest and hardest to recover. Would be much more excited by the Gift if it had a WP cost for instance. Still good to know that it exists and would help however.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gnosis isn't that hard to get as long as you can access a Caern or do a bargain or a spirit hunt. Just need to work around it.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}